% %   Verifier.m - Falsification, Iterative Verification, and Refinement with
% %   Heuristics
% %   Systems: Spiral_non (2D) | FPA (5D)
% %   Tools:   CORA (Reachable tube bounds) | TIRA (NODE_RA over-approximations)
% %   Methods: 
% %           1. Mixed-Monotonicity (Single-step)
% %           2. Sampled-Data Mixed-Monotonicity (Single-step)
% %           3. Mixed-Monotonicity (Boundary)
